            {
               "text": "#### Pyramids look alike, but...\n\nIn the previous lesson we talked about metates and how we can confirm that a Mesoamerican people was responsible for creating metates with a jaguar appearance.\n\nOn the other hand, there are comparisons that are not so simple and require further investigation.\n\nIn this lesson, we will study the case of pyramids.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "b0c0ac8e-f812-41a4-88c8-0f3eafb1c872",
